@cc [owner:fabiencelier,label:product;mcp] changes-are-suggestions
Tools of the `building_agents_and_skills` MCP server MUST NOT modify an agent or a skill directly.
Every tool that proposes a change records a `pending` agent or skill suggestion with source `conversational` for the
editors to review, marks conflicting pending suggestions `outdated`, and returns the suggestion
`sId` embedded in a directive (`:skill_suggestion[]{sId=... kind=... skillId=...}`) so the conversation UI can render it inline.
The `suggest` tool records all its suggestions in one batch and returns the batch `sId` in a single
directive (`:batch_edit[]{sId=...}`).
